  "description": "A demon out to win an angel’s heart. \n\nBorn without any malice, benign demon Phil is ostracized by the other demons. When a prank leads him to trespass into heaven, he falls in love with an angel named Chloe at first sight. Determined to win her heart, Phil follows Chloe all the way to Earth...but why is love so difficult?! \n\n(Source: Manta) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
